(6169619, 910707, 12223, '<td valign="top">The color red was used by those who gave no quarter - meaning you were killed even if you surrendered - thus you might as well fight to the death.  I can find no evidence of this particular flag ever being flown representing a specific pirate.  It is typically represented as a Carribean Pirate Flag.  It is also my favorite pirate flag.</td>', 'The color red was used by those who gave no quarter - meaning you were killed even if you surrendered - thus you might as well fight to the death.  I can find no evidence of this particular flag ever being flown representing a specific pirate.  It is typically represented as a Carribean Pirate Flag.  It is also my favorite pirate flag.', '2010-09-22 15:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
