(6170007, 910712, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find my eye led to the figurehead, as intended, but then my view is blocked by that rope right across the face. I wonder if there might have been a location to shoot from that provided a more dramatic angle and didn''t obscure the subject. Of course I don''t know. This may have been the best perspective you could get from the pier.</td>', 'I find my eye led to the figurehead, as intended, but then my view is blocked by that rope right across the face. I wonder if there might have been a location to shoot from that provided a more dramatic angle and didn''t obscure the subject. Of course I don''t know. This may have been the best perspective you could get from the pier.', '2010-09-22 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170008, 910473, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pirates wore t-shirts? Well, I suppose modern day pirates do.</td>', 'Pirates wore t-shirts? Well, I suppose modern day pirates do.', '2010-09-22 23:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
