(6170017, 910393, 83313, '<td valign="top">When this came up, I immediately thought of the song "Pirate of the Airwaves". (The original song is "<a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=13Pm8w5C7po" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Pilot of the Airwaves</a>") Extra pointage for the blast from the past and just because I like the Legos.</td>', 'When this came up, I immediately thought of the song "Pirate of the Airwaves". (The original song is "Pilot of the Airwaves") Extra pointage for the blast from the past and just because I like the Legos.', '2010-09-22 23:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170018, 910709, 83313, '<td valign="top">I should have known that someone would find a way to sneak a wine glass into this challenge.</td>', 'I should have known that someone would find a way to sneak a wine glass into this challenge.', '2010-09-22 23:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170020, 909766, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love it! How hard was it to get him to sit still with that hat on? BTW, what''s your ratio of frogs to other subject?</td>', 'Love it! How hard was it to get him to sit still with that hat on? BTW, what''s your ratio of frogs to other subject?', '2010-09-22 23:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170022, 910678, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve never understood why someone would name a ship after a brand of paper towels.</td>', 'I''ve never understood why someone would name a ship after a brand of paper towels.', '2010-09-22 23:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170025, 910625, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an 18th century Lara Croft.</td>', 'Looks like an 18th century Lara Croft.', '2010-09-22 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170027, 909938, 83313, '<td valign="top">The underexposed challenge was last week, I''m afraid. (In other words, this comes off to me as extremely dark) Not sure if the dim look was intended or not. If not, you may need some monitor adjustments.</td>', 'The underexposed challenge was last week, I''m afraid. (In other words, this comes off to me as extremely dark) Not sure if the dim look was intended or not. If not, you may need some monitor adjustments.', '2010-09-22 23:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170029, 910695, 83313, '<td valign="top">A buck an ear? High seas robbery! I can get 5 ears for a buck in season.</td>', 'A buck an ear? High seas robbery! I can get 5 ears for a buck in season.', '2010-09-22 23:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170046, 910393, 118261, '<td valign="top">I love the idea so very much.</td>', 'I love the idea so very much.', '2010-09-23 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170114, 910042, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great portrait - perfectly done by the model as well as the photographer. I particularly like the expression, which definitely suggests violence on the horizon, and is wonderfully accentuated by the tight crop.</td>', 'Great portrait - perfectly done by the model as well as the photographer. I particularly like the expression, which definitely suggests violence on the horizon, and is wonderfully accentuated by the tight crop.', '2010-09-23 06:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170115, 910763, 80908, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun idea, but I don''t think that the shallow DOF works for me here. I do like the simplicity, balance and geometry of it though.</td>', 'It''s a fun idea, but I don''t think that the shallow DOF works for me here. I do like the simplicity, balance and geometry of it though.', '2010-09-23 06:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170116, 910393, 80908, '<td valign="top">Genius concept! This gets more laughs from me than the whole of that awful film ''The Boat that Rocked''.</td>', 'Genius concept! This gets more laughs from me than the whole of that awful film ''The Boat that Rocked''.', '2010-09-23 06:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170117, 910771, 80908, '<td valign="top">Cheesy? But good... Great lighting.</td>', 'Cheesy? But good... Great lighting.', '2010-09-23 06:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170118, 910668, 80908, '<td valign="top">All successful pirates have invested in water distribution these days. Keeps the scurvy down.</td>', 'All successful pirates have invested in water distribution these days. Keeps the scurvy down.', '2010-09-23 06:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170119, 910473, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great pose and portrait - it doesn''t really scream ''pirate'' to me but I am impressed with the dedication of growing that beard on the off chance. If I was being really picky, I would say that the artefact over his left shoulder could probably have gone without incurring a DQ.</td>', 'Great pose and portrait - it doesn''t really scream ''pirate'' to me but I am impressed with the dedication of growing that beard on the off chance. If I was being really picky, I would say that the artefact over his left shoulder could probably have gone without incurring a DQ.', '2010-09-23 06:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170120, 910753, 80908, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot - very crisp and cool feeling. I look forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'Lovely night shot - very crisp and cool feeling. I look forward to finding out where this is.', '2010-09-23 06:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170121, 910737, 80908, '<td valign="top">Excellent work - the technicals, composition etc are all bang on, but the postcard type treatment is what really makes this stand out.</td>', 'Excellent work - the technicals, composition etc are all bang on, but the postcard type treatment is what really makes this stand out.', '2010-09-23 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170122, 910773, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but looks a little rushed. The composition doesn''t seem quite balanced and the background is just a bit wierd!</td>', 'Nice concept, but looks a little rushed. The composition doesn''t seem quite balanced and the background is just a bit wierd!', '2010-09-23 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170123, 910707, 80908, '<td valign="top">The lengths some people will go to for a ribbon... building this in the backyard, tying their wife / gf to the mast until she goes yellow... Nicely exposed though (the photo that is).</td>', 'The lengths some people will go to for a ribbon... building this in the backyard, tying their wife / gf to the mast until she goes yellow... Nicely exposed though (the photo that is).', '2010-09-23 06:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170124, 910681, 80908, '<td valign="top">Now looking at this just makes me feel dizzy!</td>', 'Now looking at this just makes me feel dizzy!', '2010-09-23 06:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170125, 910721, 80908, '<td valign="top">And he <i>is </i>a fine parrot. If I was being picky, I would have preferred the point of focus to be on his eye, but the colours are great.</td>', 'And he is a fine parrot. If I was being picky, I would have preferred the point of focus to be on his eye, but the colours are great.', '2010-09-23 06:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
