(6170138, 910001, 80908, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a>, then it is certainly strongly in the same style. (Compliment!) Excellent colours and perspective - it really makes one want to be there - although I suspect in reality it is a little smelly...</td>', 'If this isn''t  Bear_Music, then it is certainly strongly in the same style. (Compliment!) Excellent colours and perspective - it really makes one want to be there - although I suspect in reality it is a little smelly...', '2010-09-23 06:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
