(6170724, 910678, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective to this. I wasn''t sure about the kind of overly smoothed feeling I seem to get, but I actually think it works well as I look at this more.</td>', 'I really like the perspective to this. I wasn''t sure about the kind of overly smoothed feeling I seem to get, but I actually think it works well as I look at this more.', '2010-09-23 21:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170728, 910771, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like where this is going. But I think we need some expression on the model''s face. She looks more bored than into her "part." Also, I''m not a huge fan of the flash. It''s good for fill light, but I think maybe it should have been gelled to more match the mood of the time of day.</td>', 'I like where this is going. But I think we need some expression on the model''s face. She looks more bored than into her "part." Also, I''m not a huge fan of the flash. It''s good for fill light, but I think maybe it should have been gelled to more match the mood of the time of day.', '2010-09-23 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170732, 910721, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your thinking on this, I just feel it needs a bit more oomph to really be great. The position of the parrot makes me feel like I''m looking down on him, instead of him being my buddy. A more "intimate" would help.</td>', 'I like your thinking on this, I just feel it needs a bit more oomph to really be great. The position of the parrot makes me feel like I''m looking down on him, instead of him being my buddy. A more "intimate" would help.', '2010-09-23 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
