(6170846, 910695, 36843, '<td valign="top">nicely lite</td>', 'nicely lite', '2010-09-24 02:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170998, 910453, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia tones in this composition. It gives it the feel and mood of a time long past - and for some reason it specifically makes me thing that this would be a great photo to include as a picture illustration in the classic pirates tale, Treasure Island. Love all the attention to details. The fog makes it appear as if he is emerging from the shadows and adds a bit of mystique and menace. Lighting is great for the lighting your subject from underneath always casts shadows on the face that makes it look evil;menacing. Details: costume is great and even the detail with ''missing teeth'' strengthens the imagery of a nasty and dangerous pirate.</td>', 'Love the sepia tones in this composition. It gives it the feel and mood of a time long past - and for some reason it specifically makes me thing that this would be a great photo to include as a picture illustration in the classic pirates tale, Treasure Island. Love all the attention to details. The fog makes it appear as if he is emerging from the shadows and adds a bit of mystique and menace. Lighting is great for the lighting your subject from underneath always casts shadows on the face that makes it look evil;menacing. Details: costume is great and even the detail with ''missing teeth'' strengthens the imagery of a nasty and dangerous pirate.', '2010-09-24 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171006, 910695, 43463, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W color tones are fabulous and dynamic on this compostion. The splash of red in the damask design on the jacket adds a bit of color and cements the idea that being a pirate is ''bloody'' &amp; violent business especially when the red is paired next to the period piece gun. Details and focus are great but I wish the barrel of the gun was in sharper focus for it is a touch soft. The main object that carries the idea of ''Pirate'' is that period gun laying on worn wood planks, but the hat is present too - just not as much. I think the composition would have been even stronger had you pulled back from such a tight crop and included more of the captain''s hat in the composition. Still, it is a great photo in the exceptional category that uses elements of pirate life to strongly convey the theme.</td>', 'B&W color tones are fabulous and dynamic on this compostion. The splash of red in the damask design on the jacket adds a bit of color and cements the idea that being a pirate is ''bloody'' & violent business especially when the red is paired next to the period piece gun. Details and focus are great but I wish the barrel of the gun was in sharper focus for it is a touch soft. The main object that carries the idea of ''Pirate'' is that period gun laying on worn wood planks, but the hat is present too - just not as much. I think the composition would have been even stronger had you pulled back from such a tight crop and included more of the captain''s hat in the composition. Still, it is a great photo in the exceptional category that uses elements of pirate life to strongly convey the theme.', '2010-09-24 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171016, 910678, 43463, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would have the opportunity to walk aboard the Bounty for this challenge. Beautiful ship - the family and I had an opportunity to do the tour on board the ship when it was docked at port down here for a few months (and there was a pirate festival going on too:-) at the time ). Nice shot of the stern of the ship - shows off alot of the lovely detailed carvings. The angle is also interesting in that you have captured a lot of the masts and riggings of the main body of the ship. However, I think it would be an stronger composition if you had included the bow or front region of the ship. Taken at this same angle it would also have added interest over  just a straight on level shot. However, that may or maynot have been possible depending on how many people might have been walking the docks (don''t want people in the shot unless they were dressed in period pirate costumes) and or any obstructions that might not complement the shot. Still, a slightly above average shot and nice to see the Bounty again.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would have the opportunity to walk aboard the Bounty for this challenge. Beautiful ship - the family and I had an opportunity to do the tour on board the ship when it was docked at port down here for a few months (and there was a pirate festival going on too:-) at the time ). Nice shot of the stern of the ship - shows off alot of the lovely detailed carvings. The angle is also interesting in that you have captured a lot of the masts and riggings of the main body of the ship. However, I think it would be an stronger composition if you had included the bow or front region of the ship. Taken at this same angle it would also have added interest over  just a straight on level shot. However, that may or maynot have been possible depending on how many people might have been walking the docks (don''t want people in the shot unless they were dressed in period pirate costumes) and or any obstructions that might not complement the shot. Still, a slightly above average shot and nice to see the Bounty again.', '2010-09-24 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171021, 909766, 43463, '<td valign="top">Ribbiting pirate tales of the seven seas....lol. Very creative and well done! That frog does not at all look happy sitting there with the captain''s hat on his head. Love all the details you put into this. From the jolly roger printed on the pirate hat to the the compass rose on the ''aged'' treasure map to the palm trees to invoke the idea of the Tortuga''s . As to where the "X" is I am assuming the the pirate frog is sitting on it. My only critique, and a small one at that, is that I wish that the "land masses/continents" was much more visible to the eye (....or is that "aye":-) sorry couldn''t resist the pun. ).</td>', 'Ribbiting pirate tales of the seven seas....lol. Very creative and well done! That frog does not at all look happy sitting there with the captain''s hat on his head. Love all the details you put into this. From the jolly roger printed on the pirate hat to the the compass rose on the ''aged'' treasure map to the palm trees to invoke the idea of the Tortuga''s . As to where the "X" is I am assuming the the pirate frog is sitting on it. My only critique, and a small one at that, is that I wish that the "land masses/continents" was much more visible to the eye (....or is that "aye":-) sorry couldn''t resist the pun. ).', '2010-09-24 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171079, 910712, 106349, '<td valign="top">Is this the HMS Bounty? That ship was down in our area for a few months this year. Our photo group did a tour...</td>', 'Is this the HMS Bounty? That ship was down in our area for a few months this year. Our photo group did a tour...', '2010-09-24 13:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171091, 910678, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the dreamy processing on this.  Beautiful ship</td>', 'Love the dreamy processing on this.  Beautiful ship', '2010-09-24 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171093, 910709, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  That''s quite a pour.</td>', 'Interesting take.  That''s quite a pour.', '2010-09-24 13:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171094, 910695, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous blunderbuss!!!!!  Don''t care for the desat - it draws my eye there and it isn''t nearly and intersting.</td>', 'Marvelous blunderbuss!!!!!  Don''t care for the desat - it draws my eye there and it isn''t nearly and intersting.', '2010-09-24 13:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171097, 910042, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible eye.  For me, there is a timidity about the processing here.  It''s a bit grungy, and a bit contrasty, and a bit acidy, but doesn''t fully commit to any of these to create a "pop" factor.  The tight crop I can live with (although a bit of breathing room might have helped).  Of course, a super tight crop with just the eyes and the nose might also have been interesting.</td>', 'Incredible eye.  For me, there is a timidity about the processing here.  It''s a bit grungy, and a bit contrasty, and a bit acidy, but doesn''t fully commit to any of these to create a "pop" factor.  The tight crop I can live with (although a bit of breathing room might have helped).  Of course, a super tight crop with just the eyes and the nose might also have been interesting.', '2010-09-24 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171098, 910721, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great idea but lacks the context to make this "pirate".</td>', 'Great idea but lacks the context to make this "pirate".', '2010-09-24 13:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171101, 910001, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible clarity.  The lens distortion adds an otherworldly dimension to this image.  Love the soft colors, which also add to that dream feeling.</td>', 'Incredible clarity.  The lens distortion adds an otherworldly dimension to this image.  Love the soft colors, which also add to that dream feeling.', '2010-09-24 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171102, 910773, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Adorable.</td>', 'LOL!  Adorable.', '2010-09-24 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171104, 910217, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, but this, like the other parrot, need some context to be "piraty".</td>', 'Beautiful bird, but this, like the other parrot, need some context to be "piraty".', '2010-09-24 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171106, 910361, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea.  I would like to have seen this cropped a little tighter and not be quite so centered.</td>', 'Fabulous idea.  I would like to have seen this cropped a little tighter and not be quite so centered.', '2010-09-24 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171109, 910769, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous abstract, the tones and b/w conversion are stellar.  But it''s hard for me to make this out as "piraty" other than the "booty" image on whatever those are.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous abstract, the tones and b/w conversion are stellar.  But it''s hard for me to make this out as "piraty" other than the "booty" image on whatever those are.', '2010-09-24 13:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171112, 910453, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is almost so incredibly good.  The pov, the lighting, the fog, the lantern.  I can''t put my finger on it.  Perhaps the image is too noisy, and the lit areas are a bit murky?  Maybe it''s the reddish tone of the image, or a lack of contrast.  I can''t diagnose it.</td>', 'This is almost so incredibly good.  The pov, the lighting, the fog, the lantern.  I can''t put my finger on it.  Perhaps the image is too noisy, and the lit areas are a bit murky?  Maybe it''s the reddish tone of the image, or a lack of contrast.  I can''t diagnose it.', '2010-09-24 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171115, 910760, 96751, '<td valign="top">Glorious!!!!  How incredibly beautiful and well-suited to the challenge.  My only nit is that I''d have cropped off the dark portion of the sky and made this a less square composition.  I think the darkness draws my eye there, and away from the ship, but it isn''t rewarded by anything when I get there.</td>', 'Glorious!!!!  How incredibly beautiful and well-suited to the challenge.  My only nit is that I''d have cropped off the dark portion of the sky and made this a less square composition.  I think the darkness draws my eye there, and away from the ship, but it isn''t rewarded by anything when I get there.', '2010-09-24 13:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171118, 910771, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like Venus emerging from the ---  No, wait.  Like Jacqueline Sparrow emerging from the...  Fun image, although I find the flash lighting a bit overpowering, making her look unnatural in that setting.  About 20 minutes earlier and the sky would have been brighter, and the effect would have been better balanced.</td>', 'Like Venus emerging from the ---  No, wait.  Like Jacqueline Sparrow emerging from the...  Fun image, although I find the flash lighting a bit overpowering, making her look unnatural in that setting.  About 20 minutes earlier and the sky would have been brighter, and the effect would have been better balanced.', '2010-09-24 13:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171119, 910763, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love well done craft images.  Very artistic.</td>', 'I love well done craft images.  Very artistic.', '2010-09-24 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171120, 909766, 96751, '<td valign="top">DPCers have the best trained pets...  Love that map!  Bet your school projects were all killer :-)</td>', 'DPCers have the best trained pets...  Love that map!  Bet your school projects were all killer :-)', '2010-09-24 13:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
