(6174533, 910353, 119419, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the great comments. It was fun, it wasn''t about the dress ups for me (I make a lousy pirate) sorry that others wanted it and were disappointed, maybe you can do it in your own private time ;). The chart idea is an old gag that''s been around for ages, I saw it on "Thank God You''re Here" in Aussie about 2006 series, if you google enough it''s there. And to all ya lily livered bilge sucking rats who couldn''t be trusted to scrape the barnacles off a rudder and didn''t enter, I curses ya to ya watery grave. To all those great entries, well done, have a rum on me.</td>', 'Thanks for the great comments. It was fun, it wasn''t about the dress ups for me (I make a lousy pirate) sorry that others wanted it and were disappointed, maybe you can do it in your own private time ;). The chart idea is an old gag that''s been around for ages, I saw it on "Thank God You''re Here" in Aussie about 2006 series, if you google enough it''s there. And to all ya lily livered bilge sucking rats who couldn''t be trusted to scrape the barnacles off a rudder and didn''t enter, I curses ya to ya watery grave. To all those great entries, well done, have a rum on me.', '2010-09-29 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
