(6174801, 910001, 81530, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> This is really nice, I just keep looking. I''ve never seen the sky this colour, did you tweak the colours a bit? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Surprisingly no. I was just at the right place at the right time. It''s and HDR from 3 images. As mentioned in my notes, I am working on a document that shows the original RAW files, and the editing steps involved. I''ll keep you posted.</td>', 'Originally posted by Jac: This is really nice, I just keep looking. I''ve never seen the sky this colour, did you tweak the colours a bit?   Surprisingly no. I was just at the right place at the right time. It''s and HDR from 3 images. As mentioned in my notes, I am working on a document that shows the original RAW files, and the editing steps involved. I''ll keep you posted.', '2010-09-29 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
