(6175299, 910042, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Daniel makes one sexy pirate! Dare I ask how old he will be? ;-)  Apart from that, huge congrats on the red, which btw is first place in Canada and all other Commonwealth countries!  Woot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Red is the new blue huh? Lol Daniel will be 31- yikes I''m old!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Daniel makes one sexy pirate! Dare I ask how old he will be? ;-)  Apart from that, huge congrats on the red, which btw is first place in Canada and all other Commonwealth countries!  Woot!  Red is the new blue huh? Lol Daniel will be 31- yikes I''m old!!!', '2010-09-29 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
