(6176043, 910707, 12223, '<td valign="top">I am surprised at this finish and the average score of 6.  I ranked it much higher.  The dof and sky coloring was very good.  the detail in the image I thought came through well and it certainly represented the subject matter. I had already commented on the Flag, but truely feely the pop of the flags color against its surroundings was a solid capture.</td>', 'I am surprised at this finish and the average score of 6.  I ranked it much higher.  The dof and sky coloring was very good.  the detail in the image I thought came through well and it certainly represented the subject matter. I had already commented on the Flag, but truely feely the pop of the flags color against its surroundings was a solid capture.', '2010-09-30 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
