(6179429, 910001, 17722, '<td valign="top">Not just congrats on the ribbon(s) but congrats on a great picture. I was showing it to a non-photography friend to let him see what gets done here. Yours was a really good first look for him.<br/> <br/>As for 1x - back in college a friend because an art major. After four years of study he finally gave me the definition of what art really was. Art is whatever you can get away with. They didn''t like this, but seriously (and no sour grapes here) that is their loss. You can still display or sell this through different places if you wish.<br/> <br/>Finally, if you do do the paper on the before and after please let me know. I would love to see it. I could learn a lot from you.<br/> <br/>Mikasi</td>', 'Not just congrats on the ribbon(s) but congrats on a great picture. I was showing it to a non-photography friend to let him see what gets done here. Yours was a really good first look for him. As for 1x - back in college a friend because an art major. After four years of study he finally gave me the definition of what art really was. Art is whatever you can get away with. They didn''t like this, but seriously (and no sour grapes here) that is their loss. You can still display or sell this through different places if you wish. Finally, if you do do the paper on the before and after please let me know. I would love to see it. I could learn a lot from you. Mikasi', '2010-10-03 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6181298, 910042, 120893, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize you won that ribbon too.  A second congratulations!</td>', 'I didn''t realize you won that ribbon too.  A second congratulations!', '2010-10-04 22:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182045, 910763, 48086, '<td valign="top">cc-comments<br/> <br/>Not sure about the BW for this theme, pirates evoke colorful, chaotic images, this one is a bit too serene. It could work on a more abstract level, however it is not abstract enough for that. Perhaps a lone smaller boat in the middle of a giant sea would have worked better. The shadow on the right is cutoff which also distracts. Placing the subject on the first 1/3 of the picture would have improved it. The BW conversion seems OK although the black is very black and without details.</td>', 'cc-comments Not sure about the BW for this theme, pirates evoke colorful, chaotic images, this one is a bit too serene. It could work on a more abstract level, however it is not abstract enough for that. Perhaps a lone smaller boat in the middle of a giant sea would have worked better. The shadow on the right is cutoff which also distracts. Placing the subject on the first 1/3 of the picture would have improved it. The BW conversion seems OK although the black is very black and without details.', '2010-10-05 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182063, 910763, 30364, '<td valign="top">My timbers just shivered.  Distinctly.  Thank you.<br/>P.S.  Your Photographer''s Comments most illuminating.  It''s thrilling to see how the great mind works (turns out to be much as I expected).<br/></td>', 'My timbers just shivered.  Distinctly.  Thank you.P.S.  Your Photographer''s Comments most illuminating.  It''s thrilling to see how the great mind works (turns out to be much as I expected).', '2010-10-05 17:31:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182377, 910393, 113419, '<td valign="top"><br/><b>Greeting from the Critique Club!</b> <br/> <br/>I like this image because it adds some humor to the challenge.<br/>Another thing that stirkes me in images such as this is the time that goes into setting everything up.<br/>You did a good job with your lighting although the little parrot is almost lost - could have used just a bit more light on it.<br/>The set up is good with just the right about of other objects, the coffe cup, the pencil and the triangle....they all add to the effect you were going for without going overboard.<br/> <br/>Overall a good idea and a good shot.<br/>I just think the members were looking for more of the "Ahoy matey" theme in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Lucille</td>', 'Greeting from the Critique Club!  I like this image because it adds some humor to the challenge.Another thing that stirkes me in images such as this is the time that goes into setting everything up.You did a good job with your lighting although the little parrot is almost lost - could have used just a bit more light on it.The set up is good with just the right about of other objects, the coffe cup, the pencil and the triangle....they all add to the effect you were going for without going overboard. Overall a good idea and a good shot.I just think the members were looking for more of the "Ahoy matey" theme in this challenge. Lucille', '2010-10-05 21:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6185550, 910712, 99325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tammster:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this the HMS Bounty? That ship was down in our area for a few months this year. Our photo group did a tour... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes it is</td>', 'Originally posted by Tammster: Is this the HMS Bounty? That ship was down in our area for a few months this year. Our photo group did a tour...  Yes it is', '2010-10-07 23:18:25.000000', NULL, 0);
